      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: \nShort Answer: Not guaranteed from my experience\nLong Answer: I believe I and the other friend that would \"abandon\" our world cameras were the only ones to do it, and it occurred to both of us. It did seem inconsistent whether the other people would see this ik-ed out mute version of the person (as I do recall speaking to at least one other person successfully (the camera abandoner) while the other friend that wasn't abandoning camera could only see my far away ik version and couldn't hear me).",
