      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: Huh, sounds like this issue actually but had no idea about the camera being involved.\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/1040-vr-users-sometimes-have-reduced-ik-when-up-close",
